        {
            "title": "About Me",
            "format": "paragraph",
            "show_in_html": true,
            "show_in_cv": false,
            "items": [
                "I am a first-year Ph.D. student in the <a href=\"https://www.cs.utexas.edu/\">Department of Computer Science</a> at <a href=\"https://www.utexas.edu/\">The University of Texas at Austin</a>, advised by Prof. <a href=\"https://jovans2.github.io/\"><i>Jovan Stojković</i></a> in the <a href=\"https://cascade.cs.utexas.edu/\">CASCADE Lab</a>. Previously, I studied Electronic Engineering at Tsinghua University, where I began my research journey at <a href=\"https://nicsefc.ee.tsinghua.edu.cn/\">NICSEFC</a> under the supervision of Prof. <a href=\"https://web.ee.tsinghua.edu.cn/wangyu\"><i>Yu Wang</i></a> and Dr. <a href=\"https://nicsefc.ee.tsinghua.edu.cn/people/ZhenhuaZhu\"><i>Zhenhua Zhu</i></a>. I was also a research intern at the <a href=\"https://www.pdl.cmu.edu/index.shtml\">Parallel Data Lab</a>, Carnegie Mellon University, advised by Prof. <a href=\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~gibbons/\"><i>Phillip Gibbons</i></a> and working closely with Prof. <a href=\"https://www.cs.cmu.edu/~guyb/\"><i>Guy Blelloch</i></a>."
            ]
        },
        {
            "title": "Research Interests",
            "format": "paragraph",
            "show_in_html": true,
            "show_in_cv": true,
            "items": [
                "My research centers on datacenter design, with a current focus on AI agents for cloud computing. This direction builds on my broad experience in software-hardware co-design and processing-in-memory (PIM)."
            ]
        },
